@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

autonumber

actor "Editor" as Employee
participant ":CreateScenarioUI" as CreateScenarioUI


activate Employee

Employee -> CreateScenarioUI : asks to create a new scenario
activate CreateScenarioUI

CreateScenarioUI --> Employee : requests scenario name
deactivate CreateScenarioUI

Employee -> CreateScenarioUI : types scenario name
activate CreateScenarioUI

CreateScenarioUI --> CreateScenarioUI : keepName(scenarioName)
CreateScenarioUI --> Employee : requests map selection
deactivate CreateScenarioUI

Employee -> CreateScenarioUI : selects map
activate CreateScenarioUI

CreateScenarioUI --> CreateScenarioUI : keepMap(selectedMap)
CreateScenarioUI --> Employee : requests for time period, technological and historical restrictions
deactivate CreateScenarioUI

Employee -> CreateScenarioUI : selects time period, technological and historical restrictions
activate CreateScenarioUI

CreateScenarioUI --> CreateScenarioUI : keepData(timePeriod, techRestriction, historicalRestriction)
@enduml